  "explanation": "The question asks when the Small Astronomy Satellite (SAS) was launched. The provided sources mention three distinct satellites in the SAS series:\n\n1. **SAS-3** (also called SAS-C before launch): Document D1S2 states it functioned from May 7, 1975 to April 1979, implying that it was launched on May 7, 1975.\n2. **SAS-A (Uhuru)**: Document D3S3 states it was launched on December 12, 1970.\n3. **SAS-2**: Document D4S2 states it was launched on 15 November 1972.\n\nEach of these dates corresponds to a different satellite in the SAS series. Since the question does not specify which satellite is being referred to, all three valid launch dates are included."
